menu "Spectra drivers"

    config CAN_FD_MCP2518FD_ENABLE_PROFILING
        bool "Enable MCP2518FD performance profiling"
        default n
        help
            Collect MCP2518FD interrupt, SPI, FIFO update and frame
            decoding timing statistics.

            Profiling adds timestamp reads and atomic counter updates
            to the receive path. Enable it only for performance
            diagnostics.

endmenu
